# Windsurf Rules

See `AGENTS.md` at repository root for complete instructions, coding standards, and commands.

- Framework: Angular 22 standalone, TypeScript strict mode, NG-ZORRO.
- Reactivity: Signals (`signal()`, `computed()`, `input()`, `output()`) and `@ngrx/signals`.
- Control Flow: Native syntax (`@if`, `@for`, `@switch`).
- Accessibility: WCAG AA / AXE zero-violation policy.
- Verification: `pnpm run lint`, `pnpm exec tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json`, `pnpm test`.
